{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>對於喜愛復古攝影風格的朋友來說，手機上缺少一款真正能模擬膠片質感的相機應用一直是一大遺憾。Luxroom 將經典膠片相機的魅力完整帶到你的手機，無論是懷舊的膠片愛好者還是尋求藝術創作的攝影師，都能透過這款 App 將普通照片變成充滿復古氛圍的傑作。目前這款 App 正提供終生版限時免費，機會難得。</p>\n\n<h2>華麗復古特效一鍵生成</h2>\n<p>Luxroom 內建多種精心調校的真實膠片濾鏡，能賦予照片經典的復古色調；雙重曝光功能讓你無縫融合照片，打造超現實藝術合成效果；此外還有獨家膠片疊加、可愛貼紙、哈洛光暈效果以及 90 年代高對比度閃光模式，讓每張作品都充滿獨特個性。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x1242x2688bb-86-scaled.jpg.pagespeed.ic.J9zfgKKIp_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x1242x2688bb-87-scaled.jpg.pagespeed.ic.AZ0PxJwa9j.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x1242x2688bb-88-scaled.jpg.pagespeed.ic.CovS2hJolz.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x1242x2688bb-89-scaled.jpg.pagespeed.ic.kb0s7SJvB8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x1242x2688bb-90-scaled.jpg.pagespeed.ic.MdX302kaY4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-91-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>1：Luxroom 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後，點選上方有皇冠的 Filter。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4410\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_4410-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<p>2：選下方 Unlock Luxroom Pro。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4411\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_4411-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<p>3：看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4412\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_4412-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Luxroom</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-19T18:36:13.456489+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":471,"images":9,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}